674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EDCaEY0ve8oQ7kNvwE4B49z&_nc_oc=AdpgYc9UmV4kEaKoOnsoiw4c79ZV0Vzi0yjQna_ZF2HJnyM1vPMcYQiTdeic9xl9TBE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGytiVYEU__4YrvpOpTChFX1tog32Gjnhs5uYyktwWl6w&oe=6A86D799"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RfrhqGFakVsQ7kNvwG5rKf_&_nc_oc=AdqEmrP3jPg3J2V6D0aqUgEwXe__Gd7BJpBtt2GIBG0jucNfDK_MeiDgjPQNMvhPs9U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHDbxVu_BDsD9m7OXwG6fCsGK3S727Tq0MN1Z9q_D1DoA&oe=6A86E056"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R3WubtSADqYQ7kNvwHCMWA1&_nc_oc=Adov_d5tiiYe7HkdJGup2_Hh6jyHxNbjIZ9VhHYQgkEwU4RqGNCvdUBanZyuZXl77rk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF_2VRmSKrYQnhhBZe_TsLM2-cGQxZGHiHIIevCqCBp-g&oe=6A86DC71"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip